                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To treat someone as if they were a hero."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8ffe3d14-aec6-4fd4-94a6-47c4e06321af",
                        "source_entry_id": "b6f86c62-06cc-3b09-b21b-9b6843bc1a20",
                        "source_sense_id": "fb32776a-9549-3918-bf75-2632a536349a",
                        "target_lang_word": "heroify",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "heroify",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a23078f2-eb3f-3144-a02f-6076170924d8",
                                        "entry_id": "c7c24ccc-4933-3854-aa68-791120405211",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To raise someone to the status of a hero by overlooking the person's flaws."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9d2afda-db88-4799-a28a-dc71ca27ef80",
                                                "sense_id": "a23078f2-eb3f-3144-a02f-6076170924d8",
                                                "text": "What were the far-off natives of the Rocky Mountains doing that this restless, reckless, blood-thirsty, and cruel Frenchman should be permitted to kill them? [...] The vilest agents were permitted to employ the vilest means; and this French butcher finds among our first writers a man to heroify him and to set up his dastardly deeds as models for the young."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "edc09dfd-75db-4aeb-a9e7-84fdfe1b4b78",
                                                "sense_id": "a23078f2-eb3f-3144-a02f-6076170924d8",
                                                "text": "In writing about important historical figures, one must be careful not to heroify them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "52fe638c-18d8-4844-ae7e-6ed668881881",
                        "source_entry_id": "b6f86c62-06cc-3b09-b21b-9b6843bc1a20",
                        "source_sense_id": "fb32776a-9549-3918-bf75-2632a536349a",
                        "target_lang_word": "heroizar",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "heroizar",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36737bcd-69f5-3907-8a8b-3080f1d5a98f",
                                        "entry_id": "ed7de56a-80f5-3bc4-b899-e7eaf54d84ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Atribuir cualidades heroicas (fama, admiración, valentía, abnegación, etc.) a algo o a alguien."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0705629-0d0b-4dc2-ae15-9c5a4380af7a",
                                                "sense_id": "36737bcd-69f5-3907-8a8b-3080f1d5a98f",
                                                "text": "Sin apasionamiento hacia alguna de las panes, es decir, sin heroizar la conquista y sin ocultar los errores de la misma."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fec05801-36ae-4494-8fb3-e1425748535d",
                                                "sense_id": "36737bcd-69f5-3907-8a8b-3080f1d5a98f",
                                                "text": "El espíritu vive en perpetua rebeldía consigo mismo, necesita un fuego distinto, que lo consuma en sus candelas, que lo purifique, eleve y heroíce."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "79075358-2899-382f-a5ae-43eebd8f84d8",
                                        "entry_id": "ed7de56a-80f5-3bc4-b899-e7eaf54d84ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Considerar, tratar o aclamar como héroe o heroína a alguien."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57df4266-0542-452a-845f-b8540f741003",
                                                "sense_id": "79075358-2899-382f-a5ae-43eebd8f84d8",
                                                "text": "Crónicas y apologías en latín y en castellano heroízan a los protagonistas, empezando por los Reyes Católicos."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
